{"version":1,"key":"card:617","content":{"id":617,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a1f57e3-6487-4bf6-b465-c7a8c61068d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"satisfies"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 TypeScript 4.9 引入的一个操作符，它可以检查一个表达式是否满足给定类型，并且会保留"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"最具体"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的推断类型。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"119d3408-8074-4b13-b2ca-b9dc9771cb65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了明确 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"satisfies"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的作用，我们可以看下一般情况我们是如何检查类型的，以及会存在什么问题，通常情况下我们会通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":": Type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as Type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来指定类型，通过这种方式指定类型后会导致类型被放宽"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","uuid":"a8d5f734-49fb-41a1-9752-2363b584479c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4df0d18a-4848-4a6e-8ace-efe3660e27ab","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors: Record<string, Color> = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n}\n\n// Property 'charAt' does not exist on type 'Color'.\n//   Property 'charAt' does not exist on type '[number, number, number]'.ts(2339)\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","collabId":"f24f42fc-4c05-430f-829a-dfb4b4a23c7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","uuid":"d098f6ab-a36c-45c2-aeed-54bf34a7dbfe","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7a36cfca-522f-4182-9c5f-bbed7b232046","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} as Record<string, Color>;\n\n// Property 'charAt' does not exist on type 'Color'.\n//   Property 'charAt' does not exist on type '[number, number, number]'.ts(2339)\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","collabId":"42e79f64-ca27-407e-9d16-3115c0dcc1a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a4e3cda-1911-4b54-86e8-e184e844485e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在指定类型后，所有值的类型都变为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Color"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即使我们知道 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"colors.primary"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是会被放宽到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Color"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方法，必须在进一步判断对类型进行收窄以后才能当作 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","uuid":"cf311872-fe29-4aba-9e60-43fbf052ddae","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b65dde63-e2d8-4b90-b02d-2394166b802e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"if (typeof colors.primary === 'string') {\n  console.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));\n}","collabId":"ae3d74ca-8151-4c9f-aacc-5e6f0a6309a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e4f483f-e83d-4170-abc9-f758d32d17c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要解决这个问题，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"satisfies"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它可以验证表达式是否满足类型，又能将表达式推断为最具体的类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","uuid":"6afd28fd-dee2-4f38-b508-ba82443a01db","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"86d95075-8856-493d-b2ad-43d9c6c14285","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} satisfies Record<string, Color>;\n\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","collabId":"bb233505-b642-4127-92c7-841a7a0497f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_655f42c7-0f96-42ef-9ada-ef97744cff1a.png","uuid":"f7bc70ff-e919-49c0-b9be-ef95b172751c","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_655f42c7-0f96-42ef-9ada-ef97744cff1a.png","width":292.5000049812454,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"820bb1c9-f8e6-4375-958b-5bc849c5f1da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6b7a36e2-e2db-431b-b53a-cb89fd8266a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果仅仅是将变量收缩到最具体的类型，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as const"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也可以解决"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","uuid":"41475cf1-44d5-4f74-bb57-e26abca7463a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"20cc368b-5c1f-4b10-b8b9-f1648c8e4bd6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: '#1a73e8',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} as const;\n\nconsole.log(colors.primary.charAt(0));","collabId":"84e14f96-d1ea-48a1-9a62-835b9721a303","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b1461c81-40a1-4fa7-bef9-5a8bb2fbf3f3.png","uuid":"0fb38139-79d9-414d-afdc-94ea4ee18b0b","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b1461c81-40a1-4fa7-bef9-5a8bb2fbf3f3.png","width":330.3571484830916,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6395f544-aee5-4451-9d82-61850f791005","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f5d9e66e-d40a-4313-beda-eb28985ba3b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as const"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会存在两个问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b0fe087d-aac9-4a8a-b6c8-db67604cc754","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d1451ece-a7ff-401a-af1e-550a271a1bd1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b11a1f94-dd77-47f1-9aed-e3bc1f7e1038","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as const"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是把表达式收缩到字面量类型，但是不验证类型，即使表达式不符合你预期的类型也没有问题，只会在最使用的时候才会报错，相比于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"satisfies"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 无法即时验证类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TYPESCRIPT","uuid":"2708fb3b-fb17-4af9-b1db-54085e9cfab1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fdd190cb-3ccd-42cb-989a-2d31e468d88f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"type Color = `#${string}` | [number, number, number];\n\nconst colors = {\n  primary: 'rgb(32, 115, 232)',\n  secondary: '#e8f0fe',\n  accent: [255, 105, 180],\n} as const;\n\nfunction testColors(colors: Record<string, Color>) {}\n\ntestColors(colors)","collabId":"868f280a-81c2-4392-94b6-c5387f383061","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_32180585-ac6d-4e83-b43b-491fe763e8ad.png","uuid":"3ffe0b28-9628-4a5e-972c-c88a63233c34","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_32180585-ac6d-4e83-b43b-491fe763e8ad.png","width":409.2857212558086,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3de6f987-1141-45eb-9654-19687d047ac2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"87964f19-7282-4d6c-b6b5-9a956a011354","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"72b3a342-8a8e-47d5-828c-858ccf435fab","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as const"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会把所有的变量都会变为只读，无法进行修改"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_40151b21-2acd-47b5-a410-596c0e5b113e.png","uuid":"c5667aa9-56ea-4205-98e7-aa310d230ca0","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_40151b21-2acd-47b5-a410-596c0e5b113e.png","width":444.64286471508,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"371e78d1-c5e4-42c1-b677-cfb5aa664838","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/satisfies"],"createTime":1755849476789,"updateTime":1759033664419,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1759033664419}}